<title>UK: World Bank sets $1.0 bln March 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets $1.0 bln March 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Yamaichi International (Europe).</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $1.0 BLN	COUPON     5.15	MATURITY    23.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.11     PAY DATE  L-24.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     REOFFER    =	   L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
